OL,3,AEnergy bills will soar - here's how you
OL,4,Acan ease the pain                      
OL,6,FEnergy bills will soar by 26% in the   
OL,7,Fnew year as the war in Iran pushes up  
OL,8,Fwholesale prices.                      
OL,10,FTypical household bills will rise by   
OL,11,F#37 per month as Ofgem's latest price  
OL,12,Fcap comes into force from January to   
OL,13,FMarch, but experts say it is possible  
OL,14,Fto keep rising bills in check.         
OL,16,FHere are four areas to consider ahead  
OL,17,Fof the increase.                       
OL,19,FOfgem's price cap, as well as          
OL,20,Fsuppliers' fixed deals, set a limit on 
OL,21,Fthe price of each unit of energy, not  
OL,22,Fthe total bill.                        
